# .codex SECTION — Fields of Victory: Glorious Histories (Armies of the Empire).
# Stand-off graph over l5r5e-0.4-fields-of-victory-armies.lore (spec §25). Part
# of the L5R5e system graph; DEPENDS_ON the shared schema. The opening unit-type
# and clan-army descriptions are mechanical/overview; captured below are the
# named legions, academies/libraries, texts, battles, and historical figures.
# Already-defined: Leadership, Niten, Lies, The Sword, Battle of Sleeping River,
# Battle of White Stag, Battle of Fate Gorge (badger-clan), Imperial Legions,
# Akodo War College / Castle of the Swift Sword (lion-clan), Shiro Mirumoto
# (governance), Matsu Uniri (badger-clan) — referenced or amended, not re-minted.

CODEX "L5R5e_FoV_Armies_Codex" {
